      47.85,
      515.41,
      539.91,
      565.48
    ],
    "text": "IT is hereby notified that by virtue of powers vested in me under Section 17 of the Customs Ordinance (Chapter 235)I, P. S. M. Charles, Director General of Customs, determine that with effect from 16th September, 2019, all duties of Customsas well as other charges, penalties and forfeitures incurred under the Customs Ordinance (Chapter 235), shall be paid andreceived at the Rates of Exchange set out in the Schedule.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      580.33,
      539.87,
      617.44
    ],
    "text": "The notification relating to the Rates of Exchange published in Gazette Extraordinary, No. 2140/3 of 09th September,2019 is hereby rescinded and the said Rates of Exchange are Scheduled to be rescinded by a similar notification to bepublished on or before 22nd September, 2019.",
